# Regenerated artifacts, following the convention of the root .gitignore for
# /AnalyticalDynamics/*.png: anything a script rebuilds on every run is not
# tracked.
#
# data/    16 MB, rebuilt by pendulum_data.py in ~33 s
# figures/ 3.8 MB, rebuilt by run_all.py, bracket_diagnostic.py,
#          compare_families.py and stable_extrapolation.py
#
# results/ IS tracked. The sweep CSVs are the evidence behind every number in
# REPRODUCTION_REPORT.md and paper.md -- 253 scored configurations that take
# ~2 hours to reproduce -- and they are small. Same reasoning as
# reproduce/outputs/.
#
# paper.md and references.bib ARE tracked: they are the draft, not an artifact.
# Any PDF built from them is not -- there is no LaTeX source in this directory
# any more, and a rendered PDF is a throwaway preview.
data/
figures/
results/*.log
*.pdf

# LaTeX/pandoc build leftovers, in case a preview is built here.
*.aux
*.log
*.blg
*.out
*.bbl
